### Matching


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
m_int_30 <- matchit(educacion_ciudadana ~ sexo + educ + gse3 + region + zona + pueblo + educ_jefe,
                  data = psm_int_30,
                  method = "nearest",
                  discard = "both",
                  caliper = 0.01)

summary(m_int_30)
```

